      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": ["# FLUX.2 Dev native-reference crowd comparison\n\nDirect adaptation of Comfy-Org's official non-turbo FLUX.2 Dev image-edit blueprint. The complete 832×1248 reference is VAE-encoded and attached after `FluxGuidance 4` with `ReferenceLatent`; sampling uses `BasicGuider`, Euler, and 20 steps. No LoRA, turbo mode, negative prompt, crop, output mask, inpaint, swap, composite, restoration, sharpening, or finish. Local official quantized files: Dev FP8 mixed, Mistral 3 Small FP4 mixed, and FLUX.2 VAE.\n\n**2026-08-24 result: tested, preserved as comparison, not promoted.** Crowd variation and skin color were better than Base 4B, but Dev introduced strong portrait-style background blur despite the deep-focus prompt and identity scored 0.5617, below Base 4B at 0.5691 and Krea2 at 0.6330."]
    }
